    {
      "id": "pass",
      "kind": "pass",
      "text": "PASS WHEN the two lenses disagree about where a port is, and neither disturbs the other. Components shows S1 · service · robot, A1 · action · robot and ST1 · stream · camera, with sockets on whichever edge faces the component they talk to. Dataflow shows the same six cables with every socket back on a left or right lane. A port you drag in Components stays put when you flip to Dataflow and back.",
